{"sections":[{"slug":"射影丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"射影丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">射影丛</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"射影丛"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">射影丛是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/射影空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">射影空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">版本</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对射影谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对射影谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的重要例子</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">代数几何</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">是概形</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">定义其</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">射影丛</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为对称代数的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对射影谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对射影谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nP_Y(E):= \\operatorname{Proj}_Y(\\operatorname{Sym}_{\\mathcal O_Y}E).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Segre嵌入","text":"Segre <span lang=\"zh\">嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}